select 'The University of Law','United Kingdom','Private','University','London','https://www.law.ac.uk/',false,false,'{"ug": "The University of Law is a private university with campuses across England (London, Birmingham, Bristol, Leeds, Liverpool, Manchester and others). International on-campus fees for the 2026 and 2027 academic years: three-year degree from GBP 16,700 a year outside London and from GBP 17,550 in London. Only the main degrees named on the undergraduate page are listed here; English requirements are on each course page.", "sources": ["https://www.law.ac.uk/study/undergraduate/course-fees-and-funding/"]}'::jsonb,'https://www.law.ac.uk/study/undergraduate/course-fees-and-funding/',date '2026-11-27'
